'''Gambler's Gulch''' is a location found in the [[Safa Toma Speedway]] on the [[planet]] [[Serolonis]].<ref name="Episode Guide" /> It was a gulch with three tunnels. The left tunnel was presumably a death trap, so most racers went down the center tunnel. That changed when the rogue [[Clone trooper|clone]], [[Tech]], went through the left tunnel, and survived thanks to his speeder's high speed.<ref name="Faster" />

